  "body": "Developers, investors and land bankers - this is an opportunity worth serious consideration.\r\n\r\nRC and EPA are already approved for three standalone, thoughtfully designed family homes, providing a clear pathway for development in a highly sought-after Half Moon Bay location. The new water meter connections have also been paid for and are ready for connection, helping streamline the next stage of the project and reducing upfront infrastructure uncertainty.\r\n\r\nAdding further flexibility, the settlement terms are negotiable, allowing prospective purchasers to discuss a structure that works for their development timeline.\r\n\r\nThe existing single-level home provides an excellent holding option while you prepare for the next stage. With captivating sea views across Half Moon Bay, the property sits on one of the area's most prestigious streets and offers comfortable family living in the meantime.\r\n\r\nThe existing house features four bedrooms, two bathrooms including an ensuite, and spacious open-plan living and dining designed for easy everyday living and entertaining. Seamless indoor-outdoor flow leads to a low-maintenance courtyard with a dedicated BBQ and spa area, creating a practical space for family gatherings and relaxation.\r\n\r\nExtensive parking is another valuable feature, with room for a boat or additional vehicles, complemented by an internal-access double garage and ample off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe location adds further appeal. Within walking distance of Half Moon Bay Ferry Terminal, the property provides convenient access to the CBD, while Half Moon Bay Marina offers cafés, restaurants, shopping and leisure facilities close by.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the highly sought-after school zoning, with Pigeon Mountain Primary School just a short walk away, Bucklands Beach Intermediate nearby, and Macleans College within easy reach.\r\n\r\nWith RC and EPA already approved for three standalone homes, water meter connections paid and ready for connection, flexible settlement terms, and a premium Half Moon Bay location, this is a compelling opportunity for developers looking for an established project with key groundwork already in place.\r\n\r\nEnquire today for further information and development documentation.",
